{%- comment -%}
  Main product section. The product's own gradient (its gradient_color
  metafields) runs behind the photo, the patent stamp and the Videowise
  videos on the left, and a white card on the right with the reviews, title,
  benefit pills, scent picker, purchase options, add to cart and the
  accordions. On phones the card splits in two around the photo: title and
  pills above it, buying below it, then the videos.
  Figma: https://www.figma.com/design/Ynyo5zZAlxH0XmjA0awqJY/Baudie-Redesign?node-id=118-9100
  (phone: node-id=118-11303)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign product_image = product.metafields.custom.product_image
  assign gradient_1 = product.metafields.custom.gradient_color_1 | default: '#DDEFFF'
  assign gradient_2 = product.metafields.custom.gradient_color_2 | default: '#D1E3F4'
  assign gradient_3 = product.metafields.custom.gradient_color_3 | default: '#96C8FA'
  assign product_text_color = product.metafields.custom.product_text_color | default: '#3E2027'
  assign product_title_note = product.metafields.custom.product_title_note.value
  assign product_title_note_color = product.metafields.custom.product_title_note_color.value
  assign popup_text_color = section.settings.popup_text_color | default: '#3E2027'
  assign show_patent_stamp = section.settings.show_patent_stamp
  assign patent_stamp_position = section.settings.patent_stamp_position | default: 'image_bottom_right'
  assign patent_stamp_size = section.settings.patent_stamp_size | default: 100
  assign patent_stamp_mobile_size = patent_stamp_size | times: 82 | divided_by: 100
  assign bottle_size = product.metafields.custom.bottle_size
  assign short_description = product.metafields.custom.short_description.value
  assign scent_name = product.metafields.custom.scent_name.value
  assign product_details = product.metafields.custom.product_details
  assign scent_notes = product.metafields.custom.scent_notes
  assign how_to_use = product.metafields.custom.how_to_use
  assign key_ingredients = product.metafields.custom.key_ingredients
  assign full_ingredient_list = product.metafields.custom.full_ingredient_list
  assign bundle_upsell_text = product.metafields.custom.bundle_upsell_text
  assign bundle_upsell_product = product.metafields.custom.bundle_upsell_product.value

  comment
    Title, as in the design: the brand above, and on a scent's page the
    product line ("Deodorant Enhancer", or the product type when one is set)
    as the title, the scent itself picked below. The scent's name is still
    part of the heading for screen readers and search engines.
  endcomment
  if scent_name != blank
    assign title_text = product.type
    if title_text == blank
      assign title_text = 'sections.product.scent_title' | t
    endif
  else
    assign title_text = product.title
  endif

  comment
    Aggregate rating is synced from Klaviyo Reviews into the standard
    `reviews.rating` / `reviews.rating_count` Shopify metafields.
  endcomment
  assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | default: 0 | round: 1
  assign rating_scale = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.scale_max | default: 5
  assign review_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 0

  comment
    The scent picker lists the scents picked in the section, in that order,
    or else the scents of the product's first collection (products with a
    scent name), on a scent's own page only.
  endcomment
  if section.settings.scent_products != blank
    assign collection_products = section.settings.scent_products
  else
    assign collection_products = product.collections.first.products
  endif
  assign scent_count = 0
  if scent_name != blank
    for item in collection_products
      if item.metafields.custom.scent_name != blank
        assign scent_count = scent_count | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    "Coming soon": tag a product `coming-soon` to show a Coming soon badge and
    disable purchasing (also hides it from the cart upsell). Accepts a few common
    spellings of the tag.
  endcomment
  assign is_coming_soon = false
  if product.tags contains 'coming-soon' or product.tags contains 'Coming soon' or product.tags contains 'coming soon' or product.tags contains 'Coming Soon'
    assign is_coming_soon = true
  endif

  comment
    "Final sale": tag a product `final-sale` to show a small, subtle Final Sale
    mark. Placement is controlled by the section setting `final_sale_placement`.
    Accepts a few common spellings of the tag.
  endcomment
  assign is_final_sale = false
  if product.tags contains 'final-sale' or product.tags contains 'Final sale' or product.tags contains 'final sale' or product.tags contains 'Final Sale'
    assign is_final_sale = true
  endif
  assign final_sale_placement = section.settings.final_sale_placement | default: 'price'

  assign show_watch_in_action = false
  if section.settings.show_watch_in_action
    if section.settings.videowise_embed != blank or request.design_mode
      assign show_watch_in_action = true
    endif
  endif

  assign benefit_pills = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'benefit_pill'

  comment
    "Pair it with": the products it lists that can be bought on their own
    right now (in stock, not subscription-only).
  endcomment
  assign pair_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'pair_it_with' | first
  assign pair_count = 0
  if pair_block
    for item in pair_block.settings.products
      if item.selected_or_first_available_variant.available and item.requires_selling_plan == false
        assign pair_count = pair_count | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    The dropdowns' order: Key ingredients can come before How to use, and
    take another title (the wipes' "Materials").
  endcomment
  if section.settings.key_ingredients_first
    assign accordion_keys = 'details,scent_notes,key_ingredients,how_to_use' | split: ','
  else
    assign accordion_keys = 'details,scent_notes,how_to_use,key_ingredients' | split: ','
  endif
  assign show_full_ingredients = false
  if full_ingredient_list and section.settings.show_full_ingredients
    assign show_full_ingredients = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if is_final_sale -%}
  {%- capture final_sale_mark -%}<span class="product-main__final-sale">{{ 'sections.product.final_sale_label' | t }}</span>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if show_patent_stamp -%}
  {%- capture patent_stamp -%}
    {% render 'patent-stamp', stamp_settings: section.settings %}
  {%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- capture plus_icon -%}
  <svg class="product-main__plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path class="product-main__plus-across" d="M1 10H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path class="product-main__plus-down" d="M10 1V19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture arrow_icon -%}
  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M1.5 7H12.5M12.5 7L7.5 2M12.5 7L7.5 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  </svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

<section
  class="product-main{% if show_patent_stamp %} product-main--patent-{{ patent_stamp_position }}{% endif %} full-width"
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
  aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}"
  style="--gradient-1: {{ gradient_1 }}; --gradient-2: {{ gradient_2 }}; --gradient-3: {{ gradient_3 }}; --product-text: {{ product_text_color }}; --popup-text: {{ popup_text_color }}; --patent-stamp-size: {{ patent_stamp_size }}px; --patent-stamp-mobile-size: {{ patent_stamp_mobile_size }}px; --patent-stamp-rotation: {{ section.settings.patent_stamp_rotation | default: 0 }}deg; --patent-stamp-background: {{ section.settings.patent_stamp_background | default: '#3E2027' }}; --patent-stamp-text: {{ section.settings.patent_stamp_text_color | default: '#FCF5DE' }};">
  <div class="product-main__inner">

    {%- comment -%} Photo, patent stamp and videos {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="product-main__media">
      <div class="product-main__image">
        {%- assign main_image = product_image | default: product.featured_image -%}
        {%- if main_image -%}
          {{ main_image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag:
            loading: 'eager',
            fetchpriority: 'high',
            sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw',
            class: 'product-main__img',
            alt: main_image.alt | default: product.title
          }}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if show_patent_stamp and patent_stamp_position == 'image_bottom_right' -%}
          <div class="product-main__patent product-main__patent--image">
            {{ patent_stamp }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if show_watch_in_action -%}
        <div class="product-main__videos" data-product-videos>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="product-main__videos-arrow product-main__videos-arrow--prev"
            data-videos-prev
            aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.previous_videos' | t }}"
            hidden
          >
            {{ arrow_icon }}
          </button>
          <div class="product-main__videos-row" role="region" aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.watch_in_action' | t }}">
            {%- if section.settings.videowise_embed != blank -%}
              {{ section.settings.videowise_embed }}
              {%- comment -%}
                Videowise draws the videos in a closed shadow root, but loads
                the stylesheets listed in window.videowiseShadow into it. That's
                how the design's tiles get there; the class keeps them to this
                widget.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <script>
                (() => {
                  const stylesheet = {{ 'product-videos-videowise.css' | asset_url | json }};
                  const config = (window.videowiseShadow = window.videowiseShadow || {});
                  config.assets = config.assets || [];
                  if (!config.assets.some((asset) => asset.src === stylesheet)) {
                    config.assets.push({ type: 'style', src: stylesheet });
                  }
                  document.currentScript.parentElement
                    .querySelectorAll('.reeview-app-widget')
                    .forEach((widget) => widget.classList.add('product-main__videos-widget'));
                })();
              </script>
            {%- else -%}
              <div class="product-main__videos-placeholders">
                {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
                  <span class="product-main__videos-placeholder"></span>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="product-main__videos-arrow product-main__videos-arrow--next"
            data-videos-next
            aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.next_videos' | t }}"
            hidden
          >
            {{ arrow_icon }}
          </button>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} The white card (two cards on phones) {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="product-main__card">
      <div class="product-main__info">
        {%- if review_count > 0 -%}
          {% render 'star-rating',
            rating: rating,
            count: review_count,
            scale_max: rating_scale,
            class: 'product-main__rating',
            scroll_to_reviews: true,
            count_style: 'reviews'
          %}
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="product-main__heading">
          {%- if product.vendor != blank -%}
            <p class="product-main__eyebrow">{{ product.vendor | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <h1 class="product-main__title">
            {{- title_text | escape -}}
            {%- if scent_name != blank -%}
              <span class="visually-hidden">: {{ scent_name | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </h1>
          {%- if product_title_note != blank -%}
            <p
              class="product-main__title-note"
              {% if product_title_note_color != blank %}
                style="--product-title-note-color: {{ product_title_note_color }};"
              {% endif %}
            >
              {{ product_title_note | escape }}
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if short_description != blank -%}
            <p class="product-main__description">{{ short_description | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if is_final_sale and final_sale_placement == 'title' -%}{{ final_sale_mark }}{%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if bottle_size != blank or benefit_pills.size > 0 -%}
          <div class="product-main__meta">
            {%- if bottle_size != blank -%}
              <p class="product-main__size">
                <svg class="product-main__size-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 17.6" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                  <path d="M14.3101 9.80512L11.9118 9.1129C11.5957 9.02166 11.5957 8.57834 11.9118 8.4871L14.3101 7.79488C15.7694 7.37229 16.4435 5.70624 15.6865 4.4C14.9254 3.09375 13.131 2.83938 12.0347 3.8839L10.2327 5.59539C9.99491 5.82122 9.60666 5.59949 9.68502 5.28266L10.2796 2.87879C10.6384 1.41212 9.52221 0 8 0C6.47779 0 5.3616 1.41212 5.72454 2.87879L6.31885 5.28272C6.39718 5.59955 6.00886 5.82122 5.77114 5.59536L3.96947 3.8839C2.87317 2.83938 1.07873 3.09375 0.317624 4.4C-0.443485 5.70624 0.230587 7.37229 1.69401 7.79488L4.09168 8.48691C4.40781 8.57818 4.40774 9.0216 4.09158 9.11274L1.68984 9.80512C0.230587 10.2277 -0.443485 11.8938 0.313457 13.2C1.07457 14.5062 2.869 14.7606 3.96528 13.7161L5.7673 12.0046C6.00509 11.7788 6.39334 12.0005 6.31498 12.3173L5.72038 14.7212C5.35789 16.1879 6.47779 17.6 7.99584 17.6C9.5185 17.6 10.6342 16.1879 10.2717 14.7212L9.67715 12.3173C9.59878 12.0005 9.98704 11.7788 10.2248 12.0046L12.0268 13.7161C13.1231 14.7606 14.9176 14.5062 15.6787 13.2C16.4435 11.8938 15.7694 10.2277 14.3101 9.80512ZM8 10.302C7.1639 10.302 6.48566 9.62912 6.48566 8.8C6.48566 7.97088 7.1639 7.29805 8 7.29805C8.8361 7.29805 9.51434 7.97088 9.51434 8.8C9.51434 9.62912 8.8361 10.302 8 10.302Z" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" fill="currentColor"/>
                </svg>
                {{ bottle_size }}
              </p>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if benefit_pills.size > 0 -%}
              <ul class="product-main__pills" role="list">
                {%- for block in benefit_pills -%}
                  <li class="product-main__pill" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {%- if block.settings.custom_icon != blank -%}
                      <span
                        class="product-main__pill-icon"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                        style="-webkit-mask-image: url('{{ block.settings.custom_icon | image_url: width: 60 }}'); mask-image: url('{{ block.settings.custom_icon | image_url: width: 60 }}');"
                      ></span>
                    {%- else -%}
                      {% render 'benefit-icon', icon: block.settings.icon %}
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <span>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</span>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_patent_stamp and patent_stamp_position == 'title_right' -%}
          <div class="product-main__patent product-main__patent--title">
            {{ patent_stamp }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="product-main__buy">
        {%- liquid
          # Distinguish a true out-of-stock from an in-stock variant that simply
          # isn't purchasable in the visitor's market/region (Shopify Markets).
          # Only show the Klaviyo notify-me form for genuine restock scenarios.
          assign inventory_tracked = false
          if current_variant.inventory_management != blank
            assign inventory_tracked = true
          endif
          assign is_out_of_stock = false
          if inventory_tracked and current_variant.inventory_quantity <= 0
            assign is_out_of_stock = true
          endif

          assign can_purchase = true
          if is_coming_soon or is_out_of_stock
            assign can_purchase = false
          elsif current_variant.available == false
            assign can_purchase = false
          endif

          comment
            Subscriptions (Appstle selling plans). Products only get the purchase
            options when they're assigned to a plan in Appstle; everything else
            renders exactly as before. A product that requires a plan always shows
            them, otherwise it couldn't be added to the cart at all.
            `?selling_plan=` in the URL preselects that plan, else the first one.
          endcomment
          assign form_id = 'ProductForm-' | append: section.id
          assign selected_allocation = nil
          if can_purchase and current_variant.selling_plan_allocations.size > 0
            if section.settings.show_purchase_options or product.requires_selling_plan
              assign selected_allocation = current_variant.selected_selling_plan_allocation | default: current_variant.selling_plan_allocations.first
            endif
          endif

          assign has_bundle_upsell = false
          if bundle_upsell_text != blank and bundle_upsell_product != blank
            assign has_bundle_upsell = true
          endif
        -%}

        {%- comment -%} Scent picker: each scent's bottle on its own color, a ring around this one {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if scent_count > 1 -%}
          <nav class="product-main__scents" aria-labelledby="ScentPickerLabel-{{ section.id }}">
            <p class="product-main__label" id="ScentPickerLabel-{{ section.id }}">{{ 'sections.product.choose_scent' | t }}</p>
            <ul class="product-main__scent-list" role="list">
              {%- for item in collection_products -%}
                {%- assign item_scent = item.metafields.custom.scent_name.value -%}
                {%- if item_scent != blank -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign item_color = item.metafields.custom.swatch_color.value | default: item.metafields.custom.card_background_color.value | default: item.metafields.custom.gradient_color_1.value | default: '#FFDCED'
                    assign item_bottle = item.metafields.custom.card_image | default: item.featured_image
                  -%}
                  <li>
                    <a
                      class="product-main__scent"
                      href="{{ item.url }}"
                      style="--scent-color: {{ item_color }};"
                      {% if item.id == product.id %}
                        aria-current="page"
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      <span class="product-main__scent-art" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="product-main__scent-disc"></span>
                        {%- if item_bottle -%}
                          {{ item_bottle | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag:
                            loading: 'lazy',
                            alt: '',
                            sizes: '(min-width: 1024px) 72px, 48px',
                            class: 'product-main__scent-bottle'
                          }}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </span>
                      <span class="product-main__scent-name">{{ item_scent | escape }}</span>
                    </a>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </nav>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if selected_allocation -%}
          {% render 'purchase-options',
            product: product,
            variant: current_variant,
            selected_allocation: selected_allocation,
            form_id: form_id,
            perk_1: section.settings.subscription_perk_1,
            perk_2: section.settings.subscription_perk_2,
            perk_3: section.settings.subscription_perk_3,
            terms: section.settings.subscription_terms,
            show_badge: section.settings.show_subscription_badge,
            layout: 'stacked'
          %}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if is_final_sale and final_sale_placement == 'price' -%}{{ final_sale_mark }}{%- endif -%}

        {%- if is_coming_soon or is_out_of_stock -%}
          {% render 'notify-me-form',
            variant: current_variant,
            button_class: 'button product-main__button'
          %}
        {%- elsif current_variant.available == false -%}
          {%- comment -%} In stock, but not purchasable in this market/region {%- endcomment -%}
          <button type="button" class="button product-main__button" disabled aria-disabled="true">
            <span>{{ 'products.unavailable_region' | t }}</span>
          </button>
        {%- else -%}
          {% form 'product', product, id: form_id, class: 'product-main__form' %}
            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}">
            <div class="product-main__quantity" data-quantity>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="product-main__quantity-button"
                data-quantity-step="-1"
                aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.decrease_quantity' | t }}"
              >
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                  <path d="M1 7H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </svg>
              </button>
              <input
                class="product-main__quantity-input"
                type="number"
                name="quantity"
                value="1"
                min="1"
                max="99"
                inputmode="numeric"
                aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.quantity' | t }}"
              >
              <button
                type="button"
                class="product-main__quantity-button"
                data-quantity-step="1"
                aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.increase_quantity' | t }}"
              >
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                  <path d="M1 7H13M7 1V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" name="add" class="button product-main__button">
              <span>{{ 'sections.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</span>
              {%- unless selected_allocation -%}
                <span class="product-main__button-price">&nbsp;-&nbsp;{{ current_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span>
              {%- endunless -%}
            </button>
          {% endform %}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if is_final_sale and final_sale_placement == 'button' -%}{{ final_sale_mark }}{%- endif -%}

        {%- if has_bundle_upsell -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            The design's pink banner: the bundle's picture on the left, the
            text (split in two lines at " - ", so "Bundle and save - Shop 3
            pack" reads as in the design) and a round arrow. Colors picked in
            the editor replace the pink.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign upsell_image = bundle_upsell_product.metafields.custom.card_image | default: bundle_upsell_product.featured_image
            assign upsell_lines = bundle_upsell_text | split: ' - '
          -%}
          <a
            href="{{ bundle_upsell_product.url }}"
            class="product-main__bundle-upsell{% if upsell_image == blank %} product-main__bundle-upsell--no-image{% endif %}"
            style="
              {%- if section.settings.bundle_upsell_bg_color != blank %}--bundle-upsell-bg: {{ section.settings.bundle_upsell_bg_color }};{% endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.bundle_upsell_text_color != blank %}--bundle-upsell-text: {{ section.settings.bundle_upsell_text_color }};{% endif -%}
            "
          >
            {%- if upsell_image != blank -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                Up to three times its 124px, so it stays sharp on Retina
                screens (the width attribute alone limits the sizes to 124px).
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {{ upsell_image | image_url: width: 372 | image_tag:
                class: 'product-main__bundle-upsell-image',
                loading: 'lazy',
                alt: '',
                width: 124,
                height: 108,
                widths: '124, 186, 248, 372',
                sizes: '(max-width: 374px) 60px, (max-width: 1023px) 80px, 124px'
              }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="product-main__bundle-upsell-text">
              {%- for line in upsell_lines -%}
                <span class="product-main__bundle-upsell-line">{{ line | strip }}</span>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </span>
            <span class="product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              {{ arrow_icon }}
            </span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_patent_stamp and patent_stamp_position == 'below_purchase' -%}
          <div class="product-main__patent product-main__patent--flow">
            {{ patent_stamp }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} Accordions {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="product-main__accordions" data-product-accordions>
          {%- for key in accordion_keys -%}
            {%- liquid
              case key
                when 'details'
                  assign accordion_value = product_details
                  assign accordion_label = 'sections.product.tell_me_more' | t
                when 'scent_notes'
                  assign accordion_value = scent_notes
                  assign accordion_label = 'sections.product.scent_notes' | t
                when 'how_to_use'
                  assign accordion_value = how_to_use
                  assign accordion_label = 'sections.product.how_to_use' | t
                when 'key_ingredients'
                  assign accordion_value = key_ingredients
                  assign accordion_label = 'sections.product.key_ingredients' | t
                  if section.settings.key_ingredients_heading != blank
                    assign accordion_label = section.settings.key_ingredients_heading | escape
                  endif
              endcase
            -%}
            {%- if accordion_value -%}
              <div class="product-main__accordion" data-accordion>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  id="AccordionTrigger-{{ key }}-{{ section.id }}"
                  class="product-main__accordion-trigger"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="AccordionPanel-{{ key }}-{{ section.id }}"
                >
                  <span>{{ accordion_label }}</span>
                  {{ plus_icon }}
                </button>
                <div
                  class="product-main__accordion-content"
                  id="AccordionPanel-{{ key }}-{{ section.id }}"
                  role="region"
                  aria-labelledby="AccordionTrigger-{{ key }}-{{ section.id }}"
                  inert
                >
                  <div class="product-main__accordion-body">
                    {{ accordion_value | metafield_tag }}
                    {%- if key == 'key_ingredients' and show_full_ingredients -%}
                      <button
                        type="button"
                        class="product-main__ingredients-link"
                        data-open-ingredients
                        aria-haspopup="dialog"
                      >
                        {{ 'sections.product.all_ingredients' | t }}
                      </button>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if show_patent_stamp and patent_stamp_position == 'above_badges' -%}
          <div class="product-main__patent product-main__patent--flow">
            {{ patent_stamp }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if pair_count > 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          "Pair it with" (Figma "pair-it-with", on the wipes page): another
          product offered under the card. Its scents are swatches like the
          scent picker's and are the form's variant choice, so Add to cart
          adds the one picked; the side cart takes the form like any other.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign pair_form_id = 'PairForm-' | append: section.id
          assign pair_first = nil
          for item in pair_block.settings.products
            if item.selected_or_first_available_variant.available and item.requires_selling_plan == false
              assign pair_first = item
              break
            endif
          endfor
        -%}
        <div class="product-main__pair" {{ pair_block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {%- if pair_block.settings.heading != blank -%}
            <p class="product-main__pair-tab">{{ pair_block.settings.heading | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {% form 'product', pair_first, id: pair_form_id, class: 'product-main__pair-form' %}
            <div class="product-main__pair-media">
              {%- for item in pair_block.settings.products -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign item_variant = item.selected_or_first_available_variant
                  unless item_variant.available and item.requires_selling_plan == false
                    continue
                  endunless
                  assign item_image = item.metafields.custom.card_image | default: item.featured_image
                -%}
                {%- if item_image -%}
                  <span
                    class="product-main__pair-img"
                    data-pair-image="{{ item_variant.id }}"
                    {% unless item.id == pair_first.id %}
                      hidden
                    {% endunless %}
                  >
                    {{ item_image | image_url: width: 480 | image_tag:
                      loading: 'lazy',
                      alt: item.title,
                      sizes: '160px'
                    }}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <div class="product-main__pair-content">
              <div class="product-main__pair-intro">
                {%- if pair_block.settings.title != blank -%}
                  <h2 class="product-main__pair-title">{{ pair_block.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if pair_block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <p class="product-main__pair-text">{{ pair_block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              <fieldset class="product-main__pair-scents">
                <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ 'sections.product.choose_scent' | t }}</legend>
                {%- for item in pair_block.settings.products -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign item_variant = item.selected_or_first_available_variant
                    unless item_variant.available and item.requires_selling_plan == false
                      continue
                    endunless
                    assign item_color = item.metafields.custom.swatch_color.value | default: item.metafields.custom.card_background_color.value | default: item.metafields.custom.gradient_color_1.value | default: '#FFDCED'
                    assign item_bottle = item.metafields.custom.card_image | default: item.featured_image
                    assign item_name = item.metafields.custom.scent_name.value | default: item.title
                  -%}
                  <label class="product-main__scent product-main__pair-scent" style="--scent-color: {{ item_color }};">
                    <input
                      class="visually-hidden"
                      type="radio"
                      name="id"
                      value="{{ item_variant.id }}"
                      data-price="{{ item_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | escape }}"
                      {% if item.id == pair_first.id %}
                        checked
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                    <span class="product-main__scent-art" aria-hidden="true">
                      <span class="product-main__scent-disc"></span>
                      {%- if item_bottle -%}
                        {{ item_bottle | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag:
                          loading: 'lazy',
                          alt: '',
                          sizes: '48px',
                          class: 'product-main__scent-bottle'
                        }}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                    <span class="product-main__scent-name">{{ item_name | escape }}</span>
                  </label>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </fieldset>
              <button type="submit" name="add" class="button product-main__button product-main__pair-button">
                <span>{{ 'sections.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</span>
                <span class="product-main__button-price">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span data-pair-price>{{ pair_first.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span></span>
              </button>
            </div>
          {% endform %}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Ingredients Popup {%- endcomment -%}
  {% if show_full_ingredients %}
    {%- comment -%}
      Styled like the homepage's benefit pop-ups (sections/product-details.liquid):
      a pink card in the middle of the screen, a sheet from the bottom on
      phones. The card is the inner element, so a click on the dialog itself
      is a click on the backdrop.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <dialog
      class="product-main__dialog"
      id="ingredients-dialog-{{ section.id }}"
      scroll-lock
      aria-labelledby="dialog-title-{{ section.id }}"
      style="--close-mask: url('{{ 'icon-plus.svg' | asset_url }}');"
    >
      <div class="product-main__dialog-inner">
        <span class="product-main__dialog-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="product-main__dialog-close"
          data-close-ingredients
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.product.close' | t }}"
        ></button>
        <h2 id="dialog-title-{{ section.id }}" class="product-main__dialog-title">
          {{- 'sections.product.ingredients_popup_title' | t -}}
        </h2>
        <div class="product-main__dialog-body">
          {{ product.metafields.custom.full_ingredient_list | metafield_tag }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% render 'product-main-script' %}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ============================================
     Product main section
     Desktop: photo and videos on the left (640 of 1280), the white card on
     the right (592), 48px apart. The card is two boxes, info and buy, drawn
     as one. Phones: the info card, the photo, the buy card, then the videos.
     ============================================ */

  .product-main {
    --card-padding-x: 40px;
    --card-gap: 28px;
    --card-radius: var(--radius-panel);
    --card-border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    /* Extra room at the bottom for the band below to overlap (set by
       sections/in-press.liquid when the press band comes right after). */
    --product-main-tail: 0px;
    /* Where the photo column stops as the page scrolls: under the header,
       or near the top while the header is hidden. */
    --media-sticky-top: calc(var(--total-header-height, 110px) + 24px);

    /* The product's three colors, changing within the first screen (the
       window's height) rather than over the whole section, so the gradient
       shows before any scrolling; the deepest color carries on below. */
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--gradient-1) 0%,
      var(--gradient-2) min(40vh, 35%),
      var(--gradient-3) min(100vh, 75%)
    );
    margin-top: var(--total-header-height, 110px);
    padding: 56px var(--page-gutter) calc(120px + var(--product-main-tail));
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  /* The homepage's width: its 1600px container less the page gutters. The
     card keeps the design's share (592 of 1280) and stops at its
     592px, so on wider screens the photo grows and the card stays compact;
     a gutter apart. */
  .product-main__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) min(592px, 46.25%);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr;
    column-gap: var(--page-gutter);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: calc(1600px - 2 * var(--page-gutter));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  html:has(.header--hidden) .product-main {
    --media-sticky-top: 24px;
  }

  /* The photo and videos come along as the card scrolls. When they're
     taller than the window, they scroll until their bottom is in view and
     stop there, so the videos never sit out of reach. --media-height is set
     by the script below. */
  .product-main__media {
    position: sticky;
    top: min(var(--media-sticky-top), calc(100vh - var(--media-height, 0px) - 24px));
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1 / span 3;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    min-width: 0;
    transition: top 0.3s ease;
  }

  .product-main__card {
    display: contents;
  }

  /* --- Photo and patent stamp --- */

  .product-main__image {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 640 / 560;
  }

  .product-main__img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .product-main__patent {
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .product-main__patent--image {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 16px;
  }

  .product-main__patent--title {
    position: absolute;
    top: 48px;
    right: var(--card-padding-x);
  }

  .product-main__patent--flow {
    display: flex;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  /* --- Videos (Videowise) ---
     The tiles' sizes, which assets/product-videos-videowise.css applies
     inside the Videowise widget: four across the photo's width, in the
     row's own units (cqw). */

  .product-main__videos {
    position: relative;
  }

  .product-main__videos-row {
    --videos-gap: 24px;
    --videos-tile-width: calc((100cqw - 3 * var(--videos-gap)) / 4);
    --videos-tile-height: calc(240 / 142 * 100%);
    --videos-radius: var(--radius-card);

    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .product-main__videos-widget {
    display: block;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  .product-main__videos-widget::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .product-main__videos-placeholders {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--videos-gap);
  }

  .product-main__videos-placeholder {
    aspect-ratio: 142 / 240;
    border-radius: var(--videos-radius);
    background-color: var(--color-blush);
  }

  /* White circles with a pink arrow, readable on every scent's colors;
     8px outside the row. Shown only when there are more videos than fit. */
  .product-main__videos-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    z-index: 2;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    cursor: pointer;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, scale 0.2s ease;
  }

  /* Hover: the circle grows, arrow and all, and stays white (a pink fill
     would sink into the pink backgrounds behind it). */
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .product-main__videos-arrow:not(:disabled):hover {
      scale: 1.15;
    }
  }

  .product-main__videos-arrow[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .product-main__videos-arrow--prev {
    left: -40px;
  }

  .product-main__videos-arrow--prev svg {
    rotate: 180deg;
  }

  .product-main__videos-arrow--next {
    right: -40px;
  }

  .product-main__videos-arrow:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .product-main__videos-arrow:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* --- The white card --- */

  .product-main__info,
  .product-main__buy {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--card-gap);
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--color-background);
    border: var(--card-border);
  }

  .product-main__info {
    position: relative;
    grid-row: 1;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 48px var(--card-padding-x) var(--card-gap);
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-radius: var(--card-radius) var(--card-radius) 0 0;
  }

  /* The two halves overlap by 1px: where they meet on a fraction of a
     pixel, some browsers blend both edges and the gradient shows through
     as a faint line across the card. The lower half is drawn over the
     upper one (positioned, like it), so the overlap doesn't hide the top
     pixel of what starts it: on a product with no subscription, the
     quantity stepper's top line. */
  .product-main__buy {
    position: relative;
    grid-row: 2;
    margin-top: -1px;
    padding: 0 var(--card-padding-x) 32px;
    border-top: 0;
    border-radius: 0 0 var(--card-radius) var(--card-radius);
  }

  /* The reviews pill sits across the card's top edge. */
  .product-main__rating {
    position: absolute;
    top: -22px;
    left: 39px;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .product-main__rating .star-rating__layer {
    gap: 4.5px;
  }

  .product-main__rating .star-rating__layer svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .product-main__rating .star-rating__layer--empty {
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .product-main__rating .star-rating__count {
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .product-main__rating:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .product-main--patent-title_right .product-main__heading {
    padding-right: calc(var(--patent-stamp-size) + 16px);
  }

  .product-main__heading {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .product-main__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font: 700 16px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .product-main__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-alyona);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .product-main__title-note {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--font-jokker);
    color: var(--product-title-note-color, inherit);
  }

  .product-main__description {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--font-jokker);
  }

  .product-main__final-sale {
    display: inline-block;
    font: 700 12px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label-sm);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* --- Size and benefit pills --- */

  .product-main__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .product-main__size {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    font: 700 13px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label-sm);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .product-main__size-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 16px;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* The pill sizes below are multiplied by --pill-scale, which the script
     (snippets/product-main-script.liquid) lowers just enough, down to 0.74,
     to keep the pills on one line. Where that isn't enough (tablets,
     phones) they wrap into as few rows as they can. */
  .product-main__pills {
    --pill-scale: 1;
    --pills-gap: 10px;
    --pill-height: 42px;
    --pill-padding: 12px;
    --pill-gap: 6px;
    --pill-font-size: 13px;
    --pill-icon: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: calc(var(--pills-gap) * var(--pill-scale));
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  /* A light pink gradient with the page's pink text (6:1 or more), so the
     badges don't read as buttons. */
  .product-main__pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: calc(var(--pill-gap) * var(--pill-scale));
    height: calc(var(--pill-height) * var(--pill-scale));
    padding: 0 calc(var(--pill-padding) * var(--pill-scale));
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FFC8E4 0%, #FFDCED 50%, #FFF4F8 100%);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font: 700 calc(var(--pill-font-size) * var(--pill-scale))/1 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label-sm);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .product-main__pill .benefit-icon,
  .product-main__pill-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: calc(var(--pill-icon) * var(--pill-scale));
    height: calc(var(--pill-icon) * var(--pill-scale));
  }

  .product-main__pill-icon {
    background-color: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: center / contain no-repeat;
  }

  /* --- Scent picker --- */

  .product-main__label {
    margin: 0;
    font: 700 16px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .product-main__scents {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .product-main__scent-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .product-main__scent {
    --scent-art: 86px;

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* The scent's bottle standing upright in a circle of its color, its cap
     rising above the circle, and a 2px ring around the one being viewed. */
  .product-main__scent-art {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: var(--scent-art);
    max-width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .product-main__scent[aria-current='page'] .product-main__scent-art,
  .product-main__pair-scent:has(:checked) .product-main__scent-art {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .product-main__scent-disc {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 5.8%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--scent-color);
  }

  /* The bottle photos are 2:3 with the bottle filling 81% of their height:
     at 122% of the circle's box the bottle runs its full height, cap to
     base, centered on the circle. Tilted like the design. The scent being
     viewed has the full size; the others are a little smaller. */
  .product-main__scent-bottle {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: -12.2%;
    width: auto;
    height: 122%;
    max-width: none;
    transform-origin: 50% 51%;
    translate: -50% 0;
    rotate: -8deg;
    scale: 0.86;
    /* The lift on hover moves `top`, not the transform: a transform
       transition repaints the photo blurry until it ends. */
    transition: top 0.25s ease;
  }

  .product-main__scent[aria-current='page'] .product-main__scent-bottle,
  .product-main__pair-scent:has(:checked) .product-main__scent-bottle {
    scale: 1;
  }

  /* One word to a line, as in the design ("St." over "Tropez"). */
  .product-main__scent-name {
    width: min-content;
    font: 400 16px/0.95 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label-lg);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .product-main__scent[aria-current='page'] .product-main__scent-name,
  .product-main__pair-scent:has(:checked) .product-main__scent-name {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .product-main__scent:not([aria-current='page']):not(:has(:checked)):hover .product-main__scent-bottle {
      top: -16.5%;
    }
  }

  .product-main__scent:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
  }

  .product-main__scent:focus-visible .product-main__scent-art,
  .product-main__pair-scent:has(:focus-visible) .product-main__scent-art {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* --- Quantity and add to cart --- */

  .product-main__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .product-main__quantity {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 140px;
    height: 60px;
    border: var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .product-main__quantity-button {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 44px;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .product-main__quantity-button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: -4px;
  }

  /* Hover: a soft pink circle behind the sign. */
  .product-main__quantity-button {
    position: relative;
  }

  .product-main__quantity-button::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: currentColor;
    opacity: 0;
    translate: -50% -50%;
    scale: 0.6;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, scale 0.2s ease;
  }

  .product-main__quantity-button svg {
    position: relative;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .product-main__quantity-button:hover::before {
      opacity: 0.1;
      scale: 1;
    }
  }

  .product-main__quantity-button:active::before {
    opacity: 0.18;
    scale: 1;
  }

  .product-main__quantity-input {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    font: 400 22px/1 var(--font-jokker);
    text-align: center;
    -moz-appearance: textfield;
    appearance: textfield;
  }

  .product-main__quantity-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  .product-main__quantity-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .product-main__quantity-input:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .product-main__button {
    --button-height: 60px;
    --button-padding: 32px;
    --button-font-size: 18px;

    flex: 1 1 auto;
    gap: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .product-main__buy > .product-main__button,
  .product-main__buy .notify-me {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Bundle upsell: the design's pink banner (Figma "PDP/Upsell"). Light
     pink behind the picture, deepening to the buttons' pink before the white
     text starts, so the text keeps its contrast. */
  .product-main__bundle-upsell {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 124px minmax(0, 1fr) 52px;
    /* One row exactly the banner's height, so the taller picture rises out
       of its top instead of stretching the row and pushing the text and
       arrow below the middle. */
    grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    column-gap: 20px;
    height: 96px;
    padding: 0 22px 0 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--bundle-upsell-bg, linear-gradient(90deg, #FFC8E4 0%, #F88EBE 18%, #D2367C 31%, #C11562 100%));
    color: var(--bundle-upsell-text, var(--color-on-accent));
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell--no-image {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 52px;
    padding-left: 32px;
  }

  /* Hover (and keyboard focus): the arrow's circle fills in and grows,
     arrow and all, like the videos row's arrows. The picture stays put. */
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .product-main__bundle-upsell:hover .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow {
      background-color: var(--bundle-upsell-text, var(--color-on-accent));
      color: var(--color-accent);
      scale: 1.15;
    }
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell:focus-visible .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow {
    background-color: var(--bundle-upsell-text, var(--color-on-accent));
    color: var(--color-accent);
    scale: 1.15;
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* The picture sits on the banner's bottom and rises 12px above it. */
  .product-main__bundle-upsell-image {
    align-self: end;
    width: 124px;
    height: 108px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: bottom center;
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    font: 700 16px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell-line:first-child {
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label-sm);
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 50%;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, scale 0.2s ease;
  }

  /* The page's arrow (as on the videos row), drawn bigger for this circle
     with the same thin line. */
  .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow path {
    stroke-width: 1.75px;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }

  /* --- Pair it with (Figma "pair-it-with") ---
     A second white card under the buy card, 40px below it: the product's
     photo on the left, its name, a line about it, its scents (the scent
     picker's swatches, smaller) and Add to cart on the right, with a pink
     tab across the top edge. The tab uses the buttons' gradient so its white
     label keeps its contrast. */
  .product-main__pair {
    position: relative;
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 3;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 40px 27px 24px 15px;
    border: var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--color-background);
  }

  .product-main__pair-tab {
    position: absolute;
    top: -22px;
    left: 31px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 9px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--gradient-button);
    color: var(--color-on-accent);
    font: 700 16px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .product-main__pair-form {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 160px minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    column-gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .product-main__pair-media {
    position: relative;
    height: 236px;
  }

  .product-main__pair-img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .product-main__pair-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .product-main__pair-img[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .product-main__pair-content,
  .product-main__pair-intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .product-main__pair-title {
    margin: 0;
    font: 700 16px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .product-main__pair-text {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--font-jokker);
  }

  .product-main__pair-scents {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 4px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
  }

  .product-main__pair .product-main__scent {
    --scent-art: 56px;

    flex: 0 1 56px;
    min-width: 0;
    gap: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .product-main__pair .product-main__scent-name {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .product-main__pair .product-main__button {
    flex: none;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* --- Accordions --- */

  .product-main__accordion {
    border-bottom: var(--card-border);
  }

  .product-main__accordion-trigger {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 56px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    font: 700 16px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-align: left;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-trigger:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .product-main__plus {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    transition: rotate 0.3s ease;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-trigger > span {
    transition: translate 0.2s ease;
  }

  /* Hover: the title slides over a little and the plus spins, like the
     homepage's benefits (a quarter turn, a half turn once it's a minus). */
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .product-main__accordion-trigger:hover > span {
      translate: 4px 0;
    }

    .product-main__accordion-trigger:hover .product-main__plus {
      rotate: 90deg;
    }

    .product-main__accordion.is-open .product-main__accordion-trigger:hover .product-main__plus {
      rotate: 180deg;
    }

    .product-main__ingredients-link:hover {
      text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    }
  }

  .product-main__plus-down {
    transform-origin: center;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .product-main__accordion.is-open .product-main__plus-down {
    transform: scaleY(0);
  }

  .product-main__accordion-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 0fr;
    transition: grid-template-rows 0.3s ease;
  }

  .product-main__accordion.is-open .product-main__accordion-content {
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-body {
    overflow: hidden;
    font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--font-jokker);
  }

  .product-main__accordion.is-open .product-main__accordion-body {
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-body > :first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-body > :last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-body p {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-body ul,
  .product-main__accordion-body ol {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .product-main__accordion-body a {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .product-main__ingredients-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    font: 700 14px/1.3 var(--font-sweet-sans);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label-sm);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .product-main__ingredients-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-foreground);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .product-main__accordion-content,
    .product-main__plus,
    .product-main__accordion-trigger > span,
    .product-main__plus-down,
    .product-main__scent-bottle,
    .product-main__media,
    .product-main__videos-arrow,
    .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow {
      transition: none;
    }

    .product-main__videos-widget {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }
  }

  /* --- Ingredients dialog ---
     The homepage's benefit pop-up (sections/product-details.liquid): the
     panel pink card with the page's text color, the same shadow, backdrop,
     X and Jokker title. A little wider, and the list reads left-aligned,
     since it's long. Phones get the bottom sheet with its handle. */

  .product-main__dialog {
    width: min(640px, 100% - 32px);
    max-width: none;
    max-height: calc(100dvh - 32px);
    margin: auto;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-panel);
    background-color: var(--color-panel);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 32px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cocoa) 18%, transparent);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
  }

  .product-main__dialog[open] {
    animation: product-main-pop 0.25s ease;
  }

  .product-main__dialog::backdrop {
    background-color: var(--color-scrim);
  }

  .product-main__dialog-inner {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 48px;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-handle {
    display: none;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* The design's X is its plus icon turned a quarter. */
  .product-main__dialog-close::before {
    content: '';
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    background-color: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: var(--close-mask) center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: var(--close-mask) center / contain no-repeat;
    rotate: 45deg;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-close:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-title {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 32px;
    font: 400 40px/1.1 var(--font-jokker);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-body {
    font: 400 16px/1.6 var(--font-jokker);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-body p + p {
    margin-top: 0.75em;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-body a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-body a:hover,
  .product-main__dialog-body a:focus-visible {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .product-main__dialog-body a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  @keyframes product-main-pop {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      translate: 0 16px;
    }
  }

  @keyframes product-main-sheet {
    from {
      translate: 0 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .product-main__dialog {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 85dvh;
      margin: auto 0 0;
      border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
      box-shadow: 0 -8px 16px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cocoa) 18%, transparent);
    }

    .product-main__dialog[open] {
      animation-name: product-main-sheet;
    }

    .product-main__dialog-inner {
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 12px 28px calc(48px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    }

    .product-main__dialog-handle {
      display: block;
      align-self: center;
      width: 40px;
      height: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background-color: currentColor;
      opacity: 0.3;
    }

    .product-main__dialog-close {
      top: 8px;
      right: 8px;
    }

    .product-main__dialog-title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .product-main__dialog-body {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .product-main__dialog[open] {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  /* ============================================
     Tablets: the card narrows, so the pills may wrap.
     ============================================ */

  @media (max-width: 1279px) {
    .product-main {
      --card-padding-x: 32px;
    }

    .product-main__pills {
      --pills-gap: 8px;
    }

    .product-main__scent {
      --scent-art: 72px;
    }

    .product-main__scent-name {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* Pair it with: too narrow for the photo beside everything, so the
       photo sits beside the name and line, and the scents and the button
       run the card's full width below. */
    .product-main__pair {
      padding: 36px 20px 20px;
    }

    .product-main__pair-form {
      grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr);
      column-gap: 16px;
      row-gap: 16px;
    }

    .product-main__pair-media {
      height: 142px;
    }

    .product-main__pair-content {
      display: contents;
    }

    .product-main__pair-scents,
    .product-main__pair .product-main__button {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  /* ============================================
     Phones and small tablets: one column. The info card, the photo, the
     buy card, then the videos. Sizes follow the site's phone sizes.
     ============================================ */

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .product-main {
      --card-padding-x: 20px;
      --card-gap: 18px;
      --card-radius: var(--radius-card);

      padding: 30px 16px calc(32px + var(--product-main-tail));
    }

    .product-main__inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: none;
      row-gap: 16px;
      max-width: 640px;
    }

    .product-main__media {
      display: contents;
    }

    .product-main__info,
    .product-main__buy,
    .product-main__image,
    .product-main__videos,
    .product-main__pair {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: auto;
    }

    .product-main__info {
      order: 1;
      margin-top: 0;
      padding: 30px var(--card-padding-x) 20px;
      gap: 14px;
      border-bottom: var(--card-border);
      border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    }

    .product-main__image {
      order: 2;
      aspect-ratio: 361 / 316;
    }

    .product-main__buy {
      order: 3;
      margin-top: 0;
      padding: 22px var(--card-padding-x) 12px;
      border-top: var(--card-border);
      border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    }

    /* Pair it with follows the buy card; the tab needs room above. */
    .product-main__pair {
      order: 4;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 30px 16px 16px;
    }

    .product-main__pair-tab {
      top: -17px;
      left: 20px;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__pair-title {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__pair-text {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__pair .product-main__scent {
      --scent-art: 48px;
    }

    .product-main__videos {
      order: 5;
    }

    .product-main__patent--image {
      top: 4px;
      right: 4px;
      bottom: auto;
    }

    .product-main__patent--title {
      top: 30px;
    }

    .product-main--patent-title_right .product-main__heading {
      padding-right: calc(var(--patent-stamp-mobile-size) + 12px);
    }

    .product-main__rating {
      top: -18px;
      left: 20px;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 14px;
    }

    .product-main__rating .star-rating__layer {
      gap: 3px;
    }

    .product-main__rating .star-rating__layer svg {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
    }

    .product-main__rating .star-rating__count {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__heading {
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .product-main__eyebrow {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .product-main__title {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .product-main__title-note,
    .product-main__description,
    .product-main__accordion-body {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__meta {
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .product-main__size {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .product-main__size-icon {
      width: 13px;
    }

    .product-main__pills {
      --pills-gap: 6px;
      --pill-height: 34px;
      --pill-padding: 10px;
      --pill-gap: 5px;
      --pill-font-size: 12px;
      --pill-icon: 16px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell {
      grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr) 36px;
      column-gap: 10px;
      height: 72px;
      padding: 0 14px 0 12px;
      background: var(--bundle-upsell-bg, linear-gradient(90deg, #FFC8E4 0%, #F88EBE 20%, #D2367C 36%, #C11562 100%));
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell--no-image {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 40px;
      padding-left: 24px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-image {
      width: 80px;
      height: 70px;
    }

    /* Each line stays on one line: the text shrinks with the room left
       beside the picture and the arrow (about 11.4em for "Bundle and save"). */
    .product-main__bundle-upsell-text {
      font-size: clamp(10px, (100vw - 234px) / 11.4, 14px);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .product-main__scents {
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .product-main__label {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__scent-list {
      column-gap: 0;
    }

    .product-main__scent {
      --scent-art: 52px;

      gap: 4px;
    }

    /* The names shrink a little with narrower phones so "Seaside" and
       "Ritual" keep apart. */
    .product-main__scent-name {
      font-size: clamp(11px, 3.05vw, 12px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .product-main__form {
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .product-main__quantity {
      flex-basis: 108px;
      height: 48px;
    }

    .product-main__quantity-button {
      width: 34px;
    }

    .product-main__quantity-input {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .product-main__button {
      --button-height: 48px;
      --button-padding: 20px;
      --button-font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__accordion-trigger {
      min-height: 48px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .product-main__plus {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .product-main__videos-row {
      --videos-gap: 10px;
      --videos-tile-width: calc((100cqw - 2 * var(--videos-gap)) / 2.6);
    }

    .product-main__videos-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  /* Small phones: the scents go three to a row, and the quantity and the
     button's padding narrow so "Add to cart" stays on one line. */
  /* Narrow phones: a smaller picture and arrow leave the text more room. */
  @media (max-width: 374px) {
    .product-main__bundle-upsell {
      grid-template-columns: 60px minmax(0, 1fr) 32px;
      column-gap: 8px;
      padding: 0 12px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell--no-image {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 32px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-image {
      width: 60px;
      height: 56px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-text {
      font-size: clamp(10px, (100vw - 204px) / 11.4, 14px);
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .product-main__bundle-upsell-arrow svg {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 359px) {
    .product-main__scent-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      row-gap: 10px;
    }

    .product-main__quantity {
      flex-basis: 96px;
    }

    .product-main__quantity-button {
      width: 30px;
    }

    .product-main__button {
      --button-padding: 12px;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{%- comment -%}
  The script (dropdowns, quantity, ingredients pop-up, videos, the sticky
  photo column, Pair it with) is in snippets/product-main-script.liquid,
  rendered at the end of the markup, so the bundle page can share it.
{%- endcomment -%}

